rding the firing at actor Tiger Shroff's car.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-manipur-on-boil-again-as-3-killed-by-militants-france-pm-orders-curfew-as-protests-grow-more/articleshow/135049564.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/evening-news-wrap-manipur-on-boil-again-as-3-killed-by-militants-france-pm-orders-curfew-as-protests-grow-more/articleshow/135049564.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T18:50:35+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135049956,imgsize-1116344.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Manipur on boil again: 3 killed by militants; locals place bodies in front of CM's house]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-on-boil-again-3-killed-by-militants-locals-place-bodies-in-front-of-cms-house/articleshow/135048565.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135048565.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-on-boil-again-3-killed-by-militants-locals-place-bodies-in-front-of-cms-house/articleshow/135048565.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/manipur-on-boil-again-3-killed-by-militants-locals-place-bodies-in-front-of-cms-house/articleshow/135048565.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T18:22:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Vijaya Srivastava</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135049384,imgsize-119546.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[‘No specific period prescribed’: Rijiju writes to Kharge on delay in proroguing Monsoon Session]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/no-specifi