id-135047948,imgsize-89796.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['O Captain, My Captain': Should Congress make room for Amarinder Singh again?]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/o-captain-my-captain-should-punjab-congress-make-room-for-amarinder-singh-again/articleshow/135046368.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135046368.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[As the 2027 assembly elections approach, the Punjab Congress is strategically recalibrating its leadership. Pargat Singh steps into the role of party president, supported by Raja Warring and Charanjit Singh Channi in the campaign efforts. Meanwhile, Sachin Pilot hints at Captain Amarinder Singh's unpredictable political future amid his recent critiques of the BJP's policies on Punjab.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/o-captain-my-captain-should-punjab-congress-make-room-for-amarinder-singh-again/articleshow/135046368.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/o-captain-my-captain-should-punjab-congress-make-room-for-amarinder-singh-again/articleshow/135046368.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T16:34:14+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Pallavi</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135046856,imgsize-77219.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA[Polish PM Donald Tusk to visit India from October 21 to 23, hold talks with PM Modi]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/polish-pm-donald-tusk-to-visit-india-from-october-21-to-23-hold-talks-with-pm-modi/articleshow/135045953.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135045953.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[Polish Prime Minister Donald Tusk is set to visit India from October 21 to 23. During this visit, he will hold talks with Indian Prime Minister Narendra Modi in New Delhi. The discussions will focus on enhancing bilateral relations across various sectors, including trade and defense. Tusk will also meet with business stakeholders in Bengaluru and participate in business forums.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/polish-pm-donald-tusk-to-visit-india-from-october-21-to-23-hold-talks-with-pm-modi/articleshow/135045953.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/polish-pm-donald-tusk-to-visit-india-from-october-21-to-23-hold-talks-with-pm-modi/articleshow/135045953.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T16:03:12+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Yashasvi Vasistha</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135046386,imgsize-1167050.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['OIC being misused by Pakistan': India rejects 'malicious' remarks on J&amp;K, flags credibility of agency]]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/oic-being-misused-by-pakistan-india-rejects-malicious-remarks-on-jk-flags-credibility-of-agency/articleshow/135046043.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135046043.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/oic-being-misused-by-pakistan-india-rejects-malicious-remarks-on-jk-flags-credibility-of-agency/articleshow/135046043.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/oic-being-misused-by-pakistan-india-rejects-malicious-remarks-on-jk-flags-credibility-of-agency/articleshow/135046043.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T15:58:31+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Rohitashwa Ranjan</dc:creator><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://stat