bar's reign, highlights wildlife in its natural habitat. This artwork signifies the Mughal interest in depicting nature rather than just royal figures or religious scenes. Its sale price dramatically exceeded the pre-auction estimate by 14 times, indicating high demand.]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/around-1575-a-mughal-artist-painted-a-cheetah-family-on-cloth-during-akbars-reign-about-450-years-later-the-tiny-work-from-prince-sadruddin-aga-khans-collection-sold-for-nearly-rs-120-crore-in-london/articleshow/135045100.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/around-1575-a-mughal-artist-painted-a-cheetah-family-on-cloth-during-akbars-reign-about-450-years-later-the-tiny-work-from-prince-sadruddin-aga-khans-collection-sold-for-nearly-rs-120-crore-in-london/articleshow/135045100.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T15:28:52+05:30</pubDate><enclosure type="image/jpeg" url="https://static.toiimg.com/photo/msid-135045379,imgsize-111632.cms"/></item><item><title><![CDATA['Holiday mode on': BJP alleges Rahul Gandhi travelling abroad to meet 'chaos collaborators']]></title><description>&lt;a href="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/holiday-mode-on-bjp-alleges-rahul-gandhi-travelling-abroad-to-meet-chaos-collaborators/articleshow/135044926.cms"&gt;&lt;img border="0" hspace="10" align="left" style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:5px;" src="https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/photo/135044926.cms" /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;<![CDATA[]]></description><link><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/holiday-mode-on-bjp-alleges-rahul-gandhi-travelling-abroad-to-meet-chaos-collaborators/articleshow/135044926.cms]]></link><guid><![CDATA[https://timesofindia.indiatimes.com/india/holiday-mode-on-bjp-alleges-rahul-gandhi-travelling-abroad-to-meet-chaos-collaborators/articleshow/135044926.cms]]></guid><pubDate>2026-10-19T15:17:25+05:30</pubDate><dc:creator xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/">Karan Manral</dc:creat